4
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.850
Today's edition is, I gotta tell you,

5
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:17.390
one of the most compelling, inspirational, cautionary

6
00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.280
and grippingly cinematic stories

7
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.890
that I've ever heard in my entire life.

8
00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:26.710
It's the story of one John McAvoy

9
00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.700
and it's gonna blow your mind.

10
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.130
By way of brief introduction,

11
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.570
John was a guy who was born

12
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.910
into this notorious London crime family.

13
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.950
He eventually becomes a high-profile armed bank robber,

14
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:41.300
as one does.

15
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.160
He was then not surprisingly,

16
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:47.650
eventually busted, and sentenced to life in prison.

17
00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.070
But through this insane series

18
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.060
of just absolutely incredible events

19
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.460
that I'm not gonna spoil, John ultimately pulls one of

20
00:00:55.460 --> 00:01:00.460
the greatest 180-degree life transformations of all time,

21
00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.840
going from this life centered around crime

22
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:07.790
to ultimately finding redemption in sport and along the way,

23
00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:11.230
breaking British and world indoor rowing records,

24
00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:14.390
becoming the only Nike-sponsored Ironman athlete

25
00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:15.480
in the world.

26
00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.020
And he's a guy who continues to inspire countless people

27
00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.100
around the globe with his incredible story

28
00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.100
of personal evolution and his advocacy for prison reform.

29
00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.830
All of which makes this conversation one of

30
00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:32.600
the most legendary in the history of this podcast.

31
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:36.330 line:15%
So buckle up and enjoy episode 379,

32
00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:41.330 line:15%
recorded in the Summer of 2018, with John McAvoy.

33
00:01:41.622 --> 00:01:44.323
(air whooshing)

34
00:01:44.323 --> 00:01:45.690
And we're rolling.

35
00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:46.977
John, so good to meet you, man.

36
00:01:46.977 --> 00:01:49.480
I've been looking forward to this for a very long time.

37
00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.540
So super stoked to have you share your story with me today.

38
00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.603
Thank you for inviting me,

39
00:01:54.603 --> 00:01:56.054
it's a huge honor and privilege,

40
00:01:56.054 --> 00:01:58.060
and I'm looking forward to sharing it with you.

41
00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.730
Yeah, good, good, good.

42
