47
00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.186
So you're just gonna have to bear with it,

48
00:02:12.186 --> 00:02:14.100
but I think it's gonna be all fine, right?

49
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.990
'Cause you're gonna get so lost in John's story,

50
