you're just, you're not even gonna know

51
00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.340
what's happening.

52
00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.630
Before we even get into that though,

53
00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.020
what are you training for right now?

54
00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.470
So my seasons starts in three weeks time,

55
00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.420
I'm racing Ironman, Hamburg.

56
00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.140
I was meant to be racing two weekends ago,

57
00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.740
but obviously, training for Ironman,

58
00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:31.270
you end up developing a lot of injuries,

59
00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.103
especially as I'm getting a bit older.

60
00:02:32.103 --> 00:02:33.850
So I had a problem of tendon in my foot.

61
00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.000
So I've had to delay to start my race season,

62
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.230
