01:39:58.365 --> 01:40:01.260
So, so, so, so much hard Ironman psychologically,

2584
01:40:01.260 --> 01:40:05.803
I feel like it's more challenging physically it's harder,

2585
01:40:06.670 --> 01:40:07.960
but I love running.

2586
01:40:07.960 --> 01:40:08.793
I love it.

