2592
01:40:18.583 --> 01:40:19.960
like acts like I'm always thinking about stuff.

2593
01:40:19.960 --> 01:40:21.240
Like when I go running my bike,

2594
01:40:21.240 --> 01:40:22.663
I'm always thinking about things.

2595
01:40:22.663 --> 01:40:24.830
I swim, always thinking I can't switch off,

2596
01:40:24.830 --> 01:40:28.270
but when I run, just switch off and I could be anywhere

2597
01:40:28.270 --> 01:40:29.103
