2608
01:40:55.300 --> 01:40:57.750
having never been in a boat before and saying,

2609
01:40:57.750 --> 01:41:01.030
oh yeah, here's my here, you could look at these numbers.

2610
01:41:01.030 --> 01:41:03.160
