2611
01:41:03.160 --> 01:41:03.993
in the club.

2612
01:41:03.993 --> 01:41:06.643
Must have been like, who is this guy?

2613
01:41:06.643 --> 01:41:09.010
Well, like one of the first sessions I'd done to,

2614
01:41:09.010 --> 01:41:11.523
I got released from prison on a Friday, Saturday morning

2615
01:41:11.523 --> 01:41:12.743
