2624
01:41:33.410 --> 01:41:35.660
you can't coach what God's given you.

2625
01:41:35.660 --> 01:41:38.923
And he used to say to me, if you've got a big engine,

2626
01:41:40.980 --> 01:41:44.350
some people just haven't and you can coach that big engine

2627
01:41:44.350 --> 01:41:45.960
to row well, and that's all you need to do.

2628
01:41:45.960 --> 01:41:46.793
That's my job.

2629
01:41:47.802 --> 01:41:49.997
I know you've got the row power and it's my job to teach you

2630
01:41:49.997 --> 01:41:51.117
how to use that power and a boat.

2631
01:41:51.117 --> 01:41:52.960
But if you haven't got that power,

2632
01:41:52.960 --> 01:41:54.750
doesn't matter how much you technically hit good.

2633
01:41:54.750 --> 01:41:56.330
The guy with a bigger engine will always beat you

2634
01:41:56.330 --> 01:41:59.193
when he learns to get that sort of the technical element.

2635
01:42:00.040 --> 01:42:02.150
But the problem is you just needed to get

2636
01:42:02.150 --> 01:42:03.820
in a boat as a much younger person.

2637
01:42:03.820 --> 01:42:05.140
Yes.

2638
01:42:05.140 --> 01:42:05.973
It's the same with swimming.

2639
01:42:05.973 --> 01:42:09.570
