2640
01:42:09.570 --> 01:42:10.560
in your later years,

2641
01:42:10.560 --> 01:42:12.870
it's just something that you can pick up quite easily

2642
01:42:12.870 --> 01:42:14.358
if you're in the right environment.

2643
01:42:14.358 --> 01:42:16.360
But like trying to, you can learn to run,

2644
01:42:16.360 --> 01:42:19.064
you can learn to ride a bike, but like swimming

2645
01:42:19.064 --> 01:42:20.390
it's a whole different thing.

2646
01:42:20.390 --> 01:42:21.602
When you see it,

2647
01:42:21.602 --> 01:42:23.150
when you see people like come across from doing like cycling

2648
01:42:23.150 --> 01:42:24.483
money backgrounds into Ironman,

2649
01:42:24.483 --> 01:42:27.390
like they get to a point where they just don't progress.

2650
01:42:27.390 --> 01:42:30.080
And the people that like those row 50,

2651
01:42:30.080 --> 01:42:32.090
sub 50 minute swimmers, you tend to find,

2652
01:42:32.090 --> 01:42:33.600
come from swimming backgrounds that have swum

2653
01:42:33.600 --> 01:42:34.580
their whole lives.

2654
01:42:34.580 --> 01:42:36.700
And they like to them pumping at those sort of times,

2655
01:42:36.700 --> 01:42:38.540
isn't really a challenge where like the other guys

2656
01:42:38.540 --> 01:42:41.840
are like trying to just get under the hour and stuff.

2657
01:42:41.840 --> 01:42:44.360
And they're expanding a lot more energy because,

2658
01:42:44.360 --> 01:42:46.290
because the people who really know how to swim,

2659
01:42:46.290 --> 01:42:48.180
know how to make the water work for them.

2660
01:42:48.180 --> 01:42:50.650
So they're so much more efficient and their output

2661
01:42:50.650 --> 01:42:54.200
is to mini as compared to the guy who's

2662
01:42:54.200 --> 01:42:55.913
just slashing water, mean.

2663
01:42:57.230 --> 01:42:59.860
So how did that first Ironman go?

2664
01:42:59.860 --> 01:43:03.220
I mean, six weeks, like there's only so much you can do

2665
01:43:03.220 --> 01:43:04.420
in six weeks,

2666
01:43:04.420 --> 01:43:05.820
especially when you don't know how to swim.

2667
01:43:05.820 --> 01:43:07.262
So like the guys,

2668
01:43:07.262 --> 01:43:09.060
there was a couple guys at the rowing club that like,

2669
01:43:09.060 --> 01:43:11.140
were there just recreation and we were chatting about it.

2670
01:43:11.140 --> 01:43:13.837
And like, one of them said to me, he said,

2671
01:43:13.837 --> 01:43:15.450
"Look, there's no point you going out doing

2672
01:43:15.450 --> 01:43:17.770
a massive like rides now because you've never in a bike,

2673
01:43:17.770 --> 01:43:18.603
you probably get injured.

2674
01:43:18.603 --> 01:43:21.100
So you imagine just ride the distance in the race.

2675
01:43:26.925 --> 01:43:31.925
When I race, I see this as an athlete.

2676
01:43:32.090 --> 01:43:35.120
So I've nearly been killed two times.

2677
01:43:35.120 --> 01:43:37.700
Literally been to time where I'm fractions

2678
01:43:37.700 --> 01:43:40.330
of inches away from a policeman shooting me dead.

2679
01:43:40.330 --> 01:43:41.980
In the big picture of things in life,

2680
01:43:41.980 --> 01:43:43.990
like I've nearly lost my life.

2681
01:43:43.990 --> 01:43:46.270
So I look at everything like that through that lens.

2682
01:43:46.270 --> 01:43:48.720
So there's a really doing a wreck

2683
01:43:48.720 --> 01:43:50.010
doing a swim in Ironman.

2684
01:43:50.010 --> 01:43:51.670
It's not really that big of a deal or getting on a bike,

2685
01:43:51.670 --> 01:43:53.470
riding a bike, like it's just physical activity.

2686
01:43:53.470 --> 01:43:56.290
Exact exercises is no real great significance

2687
01:43:56.290 --> 01:43:58.640
other than that, like, I'm not gonna lose my life doing it.

2688
01:43:58.640 --> 01:44:00.447
And I just put every inter realistic terms of like,

2689
01:44:00.447 --> 01:44:03.073
when I've had my life taken off me for 10 years,

2690
01:44:04.756 --> 01:44:07.520
that's a lot of stress to go through.

2691
01:44:07.520 --> 01:44:10.690
Like when you're an Ironman, I see that as some privilege,

2692
01:44:10.690 --> 01:44:11.523
I'm there that morning,

2693
01:44:11.523 --> 01:44:12.760
