2706
01:44:38.460 --> 01:44:41.440
But it was when I was on the bike,

2707
01:44:41.440 --> 01:44:43.890
one of the pro guys went past me.

2708
01:44:43.890 --> 01:44:46.280
And even though I'd never obviously rid that he lap me

2709
01:44:46.280 --> 01:44:48.630
'cause it was like free loops, the same circuit.

2710
01:44:48.630 --> 01:44:50.570
And I thought that will never happen to me again

2711
01:44:50.570 --> 01:44:51.430
