2715
01:44:59.070 --> 01:45:01.640
I didn't honestly rich. I didn't feel that touched by it.

2716
01:45:01.640 --> 01:45:03.930
I didn't feel, I felt comfortable.

2717
01:45:03.930 --> 01:45:05.270
I felt I was within myself.

2718
01:45:05.270 --> 01:45:07.810
Like I didn't feel like I was gonna blow up.

2719
01:45:07.810 --> 01:45:10.430
I wasn't massively quick, like Ironman UK's quite hilly.

2720
01:45:10.430 --> 01:45:12.650
And I did it at like 11 1/2 hours.

2721
01:45:12.650 --> 01:45:14.020
So I finished, I think 100 fat

2722
01:45:14.020 --> 01:45:16.226
about three and a half thousand people

2723
01:45:16.226 --> 01:45:17.059
actually felt.

2724
01:45:17.059 --> 01:45:19.460
11 1/2 in six weeks without knowing

2725
01:45:19.460 --> 01:45:22.166
how to swim and having never rid a bike.

2726
01:45:22.166 --> 01:45:23.123
I was very row fit.

2727
01:45:23.123 --> 01:45:24.140
I was very row fit.

2728
01:45:24.140 --> 01:45:25.463
Yeah, I get that.

2729
01:45:26.350 --> 01:45:27.956
But yeah, and then I thought what

2730
01:45:27.956 --> 01:45:29.231
this is what I'm gonna do.

2731
01:45:29.231 --> 01:45:30.064
This is it.

2732
01:45:30.064 --> 01:45:35.060
And then I started, I made a lot of errors then

2733
01:45:36.320 --> 01:45:38.510
because then I thought it was too easy.

2734
01:45:38.510 --> 01:45:41.800
And I thought I would train how I trained on a Ram machine

2735
01:45:41.800 --> 01:45:43.750
