2738
01:45:49.580 --> 01:45:53.100
around Battey park within eight weeks,

2739
01:45:53.100 --> 01:45:55.650
I could comfortably run sub three hour marathons.

2740
01:45:55.650 --> 01:45:58.410
It wasn't hard it like I remember and what happened

2741
01:45:58.410 --> 01:46:01.360
It become very addictive because I was talking to guys

2742
01:46:01.360 --> 01:46:02.193
and they were like,

2743
01:46:02.193 --> 01:46:04.100
they were talking about like running a sub three at London.

2744
01:46:04.100 --> 01:46:05.483
I was thinking that's not hard.

2745
01:46:05.483 --> 01:46:06.820
Like I can do that in training. I do it all the time.

2746
01:46:06.820 --> 01:46:08.870
I'll do it every Saturday.

2747
01:46:08.870 --> 01:46:11.600
And I got quicker and quicker and quicker.

2748
01:46:11.600 --> 01:46:13.180
and the same from bike.

2749
01:46:13.180 --> 01:46:14.430
I was riding indoor bikes.

2750
01:46:14.430 --> 01:46:16.540
What bikes in the rowing club,

2751
01:46:16.540 --> 01:46:18.520
my watch just got bigger and bigger and bigger.

2752
01:46:18.520 --> 01:46:21.480
'Cause I kept training as hard as I could every session

2753
01:46:21.480 --> 01:46:22.430
'cause they're suffering.

2754
01:46:22.430 --> 01:46:24.210
And you're freewheeling it though.

2755
01:46:24.210 --> 01:46:25.043
Like you're not working with the coach.

2756
01:46:25.043 --> 01:46:26.470
No program. No, nothing.

2757
01:46:26.470 --> 01:46:28.152
And again, that was something,

2758
01:46:28.152 --> 01:46:30.293
this is something that stuck with me

2759
01:46:30.293 --> 01:46:32.040
from being a kid distrust.

2760
01:46:32.040 --> 01:46:35.220
Like I thought to myself there, and this is my goal,

2761
01:46:35.220 --> 01:46:37.420
this is my dream, not someone else's

2762
01:46:37.420 --> 01:46:40.160
and I don't trust anyone else with this

2763
01:46:40.160 --> 01:46:41.950
and I thought I knew better.

2764
01:46:41.950 --> 01:46:43.760
I thought that I could do this myself.

2765
01:46:43.760 --> 01:46:47.083
And as I said, I dug myself into the biggest hole.

2766
01:46:47.083 --> 01:46:48.660
Like I was sweating.

2767
01:46:48.660 --> 01:46:50.450
I was waking up in the early hours and when sweating,

2768
01:46:50.450 --> 01:46:52.340
I was getting up early and then to me,

2769
01:46:52.340 --> 01:46:54.780
then it become how much do I like,

2770
01:46:54.780 --> 01:46:55.910
even though I feel like crap,

2771
01:46:55.910 --> 01:46:57.610
I'm just gonna go out and just keep hammering it.

2772
01:46:57.610 --> 01:46:58.820
And I gonna hammer it.

2773
01:46:58.820 --> 01:47:00.517
And again, I just kept digging this hole

2774
01:47:00.517 --> 01:47:01.710
and I was getting quicker,

2775
01:47:01.710 --> 01:47:03.317
but my body wasn't recovering, it was breaking down.

2776
01:47:03.317 --> 01:47:04.860
It was breaking down.

2777
01:47:04.860 --> 01:47:07.636
And then I ended up really getting sick.

2778
01:47:07.636 --> 01:47:09.810
I went on a training camp and I remember went

2779
01:47:09.810 --> 01:47:11.970
for a swim one morning and I couldn't breathe.

2780
01:47:11.970 --> 01:47:12.980
And I thought, what?

2781
01:47:12.980 --> 01:47:14.270
Like, I've never felt anything.

2782
01:47:14.270 --> 01:47:15.450
I could not breathe, physically breathe.

2783
01:47:15.450 --> 01:47:16.920
And I got outta water.

2784
01:47:16.920 --> 01:47:18.560
And then later on that I was in the car.

2785
01:47:18.560 --> 01:47:19.530
Couldn't breathe again.

2786
01:47:19.530 --> 01:47:20.980
And obviously I was having like a panic attack

2787
01:47:20.980 --> 01:47:25.000
where I was draining the life out my body got a virus,

2788
01:47:25.000 --> 01:47:27.380
then went back to Ironman, Katie,

2789
01:47:27.380 --> 01:47:31.580
the following year and just absolutely fell apart.

2790
01:47:31.580 --> 01:47:35.950
It was the most humiliated I'd ever felt in my life.

2791
01:47:35.950 --> 01:47:39.000
I felt worse that day than I ever did

2792
01:47:39.000 --> 01:47:40.400
being in any of those courts,

2793
01:47:40.400 --> 01:47:42.750
getting that life sentence that I felt ashamed.

2794
01:47:44.266 --> 01:47:46.410
Well, my friends, Terry come up,

2795
01:47:46.410 --> 01:47:47.580
my really close friend and Darren,

2796
01:47:47.580 --> 01:47:48.890
the prison officer come up.

2797
01:47:48.890 --> 01:47:50.680
And I remember like them being on the side of the course.

2798
01:47:50.680 --> 01:47:51.890
I feel I let everyone down.

2799
01:47:51.890 --> 01:47:55.030
They put a lot of time and I come away from that race

2800
01:47:55.030 --> 01:47:58.313
and I realized I didn't have the skills to coach myself.

2801
01:47:59.550 --> 01:48:01.190
Or the humility.

2802
01:48:01.190 --> 01:48:03.280
The humility is the big lesson there

2803
01:48:03.280 --> 01:48:06.490
going from this stubborn guy who thinks he knows best.

2804
01:48:06.490 --> 01:48:08.240
You can't be a great athlete without

2805
01:48:08.240 --> 01:48:10.210
the humility to be able to take direction

2806
01:48:10.210 --> 01:48:12.480
from people who want to help you.

2807
01:48:12.480 --> 01:48:14.880
Totally, and I had to realize that,

